cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now an expert defender must switch to a heart because those clubs are very intimidating. And I bid 3@D not knowing North had 6 diamonds meaning if I were following the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| I have to have 4 diamonds since North might only have 5 and West has to be out of diamonds.|
