pg| ***** 73 ***** |


up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This was an illustration of where our side had to engage in aggressive defense. Many times you play ^*BPassive^*n defense meaning you try not to give tricks away. |
PG| ***** 74 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|However, particularly when you see a long running suit with lots of potential discards you must play aggressive defense and take your tricks before declarer runs their suit as on this hand.|
PG| ***** 75 ***** |


